@ref Employment Insurance Regulations reg 36(15) (src:651)
GIVEN facts IS A LIST OF `er3 Fact about earnings to be allocated`
GIVETH A MAYBE `er3 Manner of allocation`
DECIDE `reg 36(15) pension moneys paid or payable in a lump sum` IS
