       AND `reg 36 the fact holds of the earnings` `er3 earnings: paid or payable in a lump sum` facts
    THEN JUST `er3 manner: lump-sum pension moneys, at the weekly annuity amount from the first week`
    ELSE NOTHING

-- src:651 | (15) The moneys referred to in paragraph 35(2)(e) that are paid or payable to a claimant in a lump sum shall be allocated beginning with the first week that those moneys are paid or payable to the claimant in such a manner that those moneys are equal in each week to the weekly amount, calculated in accordance with subsection (17), to which the claimant would have been entitled if the lump sum payment had been paid as an annuity.
@ref Employment Insurance Regulations reg 36(15) (src:651)
